# Skin tones in the emoji picker on the Galaxy Z Fold6: the six tones are wider than the outer
# display, where the long press crashed the IME. Long press opens the tones, a tap types one.
# 👋 must be visible when the picker opens (recents or the first page).
screen press bar:emoji
wait 800
screen hold emoji:👋
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏽
expect 👋🏽
